OL,3,GNEWSAPolice find body in search for
OL,4,Amissing woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice searching for a woman who was
OL,7,Fmissing for almost four weeks have
OL,8,Ffound a body.
OL,10,FThe body was discovered inside a black
OL,11,Fvehicle found in undergrowth down an
OL,12,Fembankment on the A172, at its junction
OL,13,Fwith the A19 near the Cleveland
OL,14,FTontine, on Tuesday evening, North
OL,15,FYorkshire Police said.
OL,17,FAlthough formal identification has yet
OL,18,Fto take place, police said they
OL,19,Fbelieved the body to be that of Tracey
OL,20,FSmith, 57, from Stokesley, who went
OL,21,Fmissing on 24 July.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
