OL,3,GNEWSAPolice find body in search for
OL,4,Amissing woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said the road had remained
OL,7,Fclosed for most of the day to allow the
OL,8,Fscene to be examined and the vehicle
OL,9,Frecovered - which had taken "longer
OL,10,Fthan usual" due to the location of
OL,11,Fvehicle. It will reopen later this
OL,12,Fevening.
